OL,3,GNEWSA'Difficult decision' to close
OL,4,ASamaritans branch after more than 50
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn elected representative has called
OL,8,Ffor "answers" after the closure of the
OL,9,FOmagh, County Tyrone, branch of the
OL,10,FSamaritans charity.
OL,12,FFounded in 1953, the Samaritans focus
OL,13,Fon preventing suicides by connecting
OL,14,Ftrained volunteers with people who are
OL,15,Fstruggling. The charity estimates it
OL,16,Fanswers a call for help every 10
OL,17,Fseconds.
OL,19,FThe Omagh branch, which had been part
OL,20,Fof the community for more than 50
OL,21,Fyears, had about 20 'active'
OL,22,Fvolunteers, the charity said.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
