OL,3,GNEWSA'Difficult decision' to close
OL,4,ASamaritans branch after more than 50
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a statement, the charity said "due
OL,8,Fto circumstances beyond anyone's
OL,9,Fcontrol" a "difficult decision" was
OL,10,Freached to close the branch.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
